# Secrets

- Never print, log, commit, or put secrets in handoffs, prompts, or screenshots.
- Reference environment-variable names only. Do not ask anyone to paste a token into chat.
- Real `.env*` files are gitignored. Bootstrap sources stay in ignored `.ai/private/`.
- Production data mutation, production deploys, and credential entry are human-gated (`REVIEW_REQUIRED`).
- Least privilege. Fail closed on ambiguous permissions.
